{"theorems":[{"slogan_id":5592308,"theorem_id":20655858,"name":"Theorem 3.2","body":"For any connected matrix weighted graph $G$ with $L=L(G)$\\[ \\begin{aligned} L\\,  L^+=I_{nk}-\\frac{1}{n}\\mathbb {J}_n\\otimes I_k= L^+\\,  L=L\\,  X \\end{aligned} \\]where each weight is a positive definite matrix of order k.","slogan":"A connected graph with matrix weights has a Laplacian matrix L. The pseudoinverse of L satisfies an identity involving the identity matrix and a block matrix of all ones. This identity holds when each weight is a positive definite matrix of fixed order.","theorem_type":"theorem","label":null,"link":null,"paper":{"paper_id":"1803.09144v1","source":"arXiv","title":"A study on resistance matrix of graphs","authors":["Deepak Sarma"],"link":"http://arxiv.org/abs/1803.09144v1","summary":null,"journal_ref":null,"primary_category":"math.CO","categories":["math.CO"],"citations":0,"year":2018,"journal_published":false},"similarity":0.7805083728442637,"score":0.7805083728442637,"has_metadata":true},{"slogan_id":1560116,"theorem_id":17584187,"name":"Theorem 3","body":"If $G$ is connected, $a_{pq}\\ne 0$, and $\\{ p,q\\} $ is a cut-edge, then\\[  c^F(p,q)=2\\frac{\\bm {w}_{pq}^\\top S^{-1}DS^{-1}DS^{-1}\\bm {w}_{pq}}{\\mu (p,q)}.  \\]","slogan":"If a graph is connected and an edge is a cut-edge with nonzero weight, then the effective resistance between its endpoints equals twice a specific expression involving the weight vector and the graph's Laplacian pseudoinverse. This expression is a ratio where the numerator contains the product of the weight vector with three instances of the pseudoinverse and a degree matrix. The denominator is the weight of the edge. The formula provides a closed-form for the resistance in terms of the graph's structure.","theorem_type":"theorem","label":null,"link":null,"paper":{"paper_id":"2508.21506v1","source":"arXiv","title":"The Derivative of Kemeny's Constant as a Centrality Measure in Undirected Graphs","authors":["Dario A. Bini","Beatrice Meini","Federico Poloni"],"link":"http://arxiv.org/abs/2508.21506v1","summary":null,"journal_ref":null,"primary_category":"math.NA","categories":["math.NA"],"citations":0,"year":2025,"journal_published":false},"similarity":0.7770469321580694,"score":0.7770469321580694,"has_metadata":true}]}